\subsection{Firmware Framework: Xiaozhi-ESP32}
The edge device runs the open-source \textit{xiaozhi-esp32} firmware (version 1.8.5), developed on the Espressif IoT Development Framework (ESP-IDF v5.x) using FreeRTOS. The firmware architecture partitions responsibilities across dedicated FreeRTOS tasks pinned to specific processor cores:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Core 0 (Networking and Display):} Executes the Wi-Fi protocol stack, LwIP TCP/IP stack, full-duplex WebSocket client, and SPI DMA display refresh routines.
    \item \textbf{Core 1 (Audio DSP and Sensing):} Dedicated strictly to real-time audio acquisition, Voice Activity Detection (VAD), Opus audio frame encoding/decoding, camera frame capture, and peripheral interrupt handling.
\end{itemize}

