\section{Experimental Setup and Evaluation Protocol}

To rigorously assess the performance of the UNIHIKER K10 conversational agent, a comprehensive hardware-in-the-loop experimental testbed was constructed in the laboratory. 

\subsection{Experimental Testbed Instrumentation}
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Network Benchmarking:} The UNIHIKER K10 was connected to an isolated 2.4~GHz Wi-Fi access point configured with an 802.11n profile (WPA2-PSK). Network round-trip times (RTT) and packet inter-arrival jitter were monitored using Wireshark packet capture on an intermediate gateway router.
    \item \textbf{Power and Current Profiling:} Supply current and instantaneous power dissipation were captured using an Otii Arc precision power analyzer connected to the 5~V DC supply rails of the board, sampling at 4~kHz across all active operational states.
    \item \textbf{Acoustic Noise Generation:} Testing was conducted inside a semi-anechoic acoustic chamber. Calibrated pink noise was delivered through an external studio monitor at sound pressure levels (SPL) of 35~dB (quiet baseline), 55~dB (typical office/classroom ambient), and 70~dB (high ambient noise), measured via a digital sound level meter placed 30~cm from the board's MEMS microphone.
\end{itemize}

\subsection{Evaluation Dataset and Utterance Profiles}
The evaluation suite comprised 100 standardized voice queries, evenly split between English (50 queries) and Hindi (50 queries). The queries were categorized across three complexity tiers:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Short Utterances (1--5 words):} Basic commands and queries (e.g., ``What time is it?'', ``Light ko blue kar do'', ``Hello Jarvis'').
    \item \textbf{Medium Utterances (6--15 words):} General knowledge and factual inquiries (e.g., ``What is the capital of India and its population?'', ``Mujhe batao computer virus kaise kaam karta hai'').
    \item \textbf{Long Utterances (16--30 words):} Multi-step contextual questions and reasoning prompts (e.g., ``Explain how solar panels generate electricity from sunlight in simple words'', ``Artificial intelligence aur machine learning mein kya farak hota hai vistaar se bataiye'').
\end{itemize}

