\section{Results and Performance Analysis}

\subsection{Conversational Latency Breakdown}
To address \textbf{RQ$_1$}, Table~\ref{tab:latency_breakdown} presents the empirical latency distribution decomposed across individual operational stages for both English and Hindi voice interactions. Measurements represent the statistical mean across 30 repeated trials per tier under a stable 2.4~GHz Wi-Fi connection ($RTT \approx 28$\,ms).

\begin{table*}[htbp]
\centering
